# Governance rules — guards on agent behavior and tool use

GOVERNANCE[8]{id,effect,domain,trigger,condition,message}:
no-force-push,forbid,Git,push --force,,Use --force-with-lease or revert
no-main-commit,forbid,Git,commit on main/master,,Work on feature branches
no-reset-hard,forbid,Git,reset --hard,,Prefer revert or stash
no-secrets-commit,forbid,Git,commit .env or credentials,,Add to .gitignore
no-rm-rf,forbid,Bash,rm -rf without explicit path,,Always specify full path
no-sudo,discourage,Bash,sudo,,Avoid privilege escalation unless required
prefer-structured-log,prefer,Python,logging or print,,Use structlog for all output
require-pr-review,prefer,Git,merge to main,branch:main,All changes require PR review
